# Random modules with require_<det>, require_complete_switch and
# require_switch_arms_<det> scopes of random determinisms around their
# disjunctions and calls, on the variables the disjunctions test or now
# and then others (generate-switch-programs.py --determinism --requires). merkc must infer
# the determinisms of the procedures and their goals that mmc does, and
# report its errors, those for the requirements among them, at the same
# lines.
#
# REQUIRES: mmc
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir %t
# RUN: %python %S/../../../utils/type-oracle/generate-switch-programs.py --determinism --requires --seed 1 --count 40 %t
# RUN: %compare-switches --determinism %t/*.m
